cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Graphas"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for speech graph analysis: it represents a speech
  transcription as a directed word graph and extracts the structural features
  used to quantify how organized or fragmented a discourse is.
